        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The second amended and restated memorandum and articles of association of the Company be amended by replacing Article&#160;18.2(a) in its entirety with the following: </font>
